OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree: NI Secretary urges calm
OL,4,Aamid major public safety operation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,7,F(PSNI) has said a "major public safety
OL,8,Foperation" will continue in Portadown
OL,9,Fthis weekend.
OL,11,FThe PSNI is "continuing to seek safe
OL,12,Fand peaceful compliance with the
OL,13,FParades Commission determination" at
OL,14,FDrumcree and said its "investigation
OL,15,Finto anyone suspected of breaking the
OL,16,Flaw related to this dispute is
OL,17,Fcontinuing at pace".
OL,19,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,20,FBryant urged calm and said "everyone
OL,21,Facross Northern Ireland wants a
OL,22,Fpeaceful resolution to the situation".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
