OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree: NI Secretary urges calm
OL,4,Aamid major public safety operation
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, the PSNI chief constable
OL,7,Fsaid there would be an investigation
OL,8,Fafter protesters blocked the mainly
OL,9,Fnationalist road to prevent an Orange
OL,10,FOrder parade from happening.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
